WEBVTT

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:21.350
What's the meaning of this?

00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:23.830
It's sparkling so brilliantly...

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:25.540
Why doesn't it have any power?

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:30.050
Where did the power of the 
seven Prism Stones go?

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:32.740
We have to find it no matter what.

00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:37.440
But it's only a matter of 
time before we find it.

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:40.770
That's because the keeper of 
the stones is right here...

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:41.870
Aren't you?

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:43.800
You're irritating, old man.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:44.880
Did you say something?

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:46.190
Not really.

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:47.810
You're irritating, old man.

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:48.350
Oh, no!

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:52.160
If you don't tell us where the stones are...

00:00:54.260 --> 00:00:56.200
I'll feed you to the cockatoo.

00:00:56.480 --> 00:00:59.380
I'll have you know that 
the power of the stones

00:00:59.380 --> 00:01:02.010
will only come out once they're 
returned to the Prism Hopish.

00:01:02.010 --> 00:01:05.040
And I'm the only one who knows how to do it,

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:08.260
so if you do away with me, you won't be able

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:10.360
to bring the power of the seven 
stones back to the Hopish.

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:13.400
And you'll never be able to bring 
forth the power of the stones.

00:01:18.470 --> 00:01:19.930
It can't be helped.

00:01:19.930 --> 00:01:22.900
We'll have to use the energy we stored 
up from the Field of Rainbows,

00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:25.680
and restore Jyaku-King back to life.

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:27.630
Shall we ask those people?

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:29.680
Since they all have the power of light,

00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:31.620
they must be connected somehow.

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:36.100
If we pressure the legendary 
warriors, we may find a clue.

00:01:38.630 --> 00:01:40.540
I'll be waiting in Dotsuku Zone.

00:01:45.380 --> 00:01:47.990
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:47.990 --> 00:01:50.790
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:53.620
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:53.620 --> 00:01:57.900
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:57.900 --> 00:02:00.870
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:03.740
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:02:03.740 --> 00:02:05.640
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:09.540
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:11.140
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:16.950
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot, we both</i>

00:02:17.580 --> 00:02:19.050
<i>become stronger</i>

00:02:19.050 --> 00:02:22.820
<i>and closer</i>

00:02:23.820 --> 00:02:26.820
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:02:26.820 --> 00:02:29.390
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:02:29.660 --> 00:02:32.560
<i>Don't you know that good fortune 
comes to the gates of laughter?</i>

00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:35.430
<i>Out with the negative!</i>

00:02:35.430 --> 00:02:41.710
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:02:41.710 --> 00:02:42.610
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:02:42.610 --> 00:02:45.310
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:48.110
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:48.110 --> 00:02:51.020
<i>We're pretty and cure cure</i>

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:52.580
<i>Together we are</i>

00:02:52.580 --> 00:02:55.650
<i>Pretty Cure...!</i>

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:12.240
The new dark warriors that have appeared...

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:15.510
Their power isn't any ordinary power...

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:21.350
What in the world was that power anyway?

00:03:21.350 --> 00:03:23.420
It seemed to have come from Pollun, but...

00:03:34.050 --> 00:03:38.810
But they got the Prism Stones 
and Stone Keeper, too.

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:41.410
What are we going to do?

00:03:41.710 --> 00:03:42.600
Popo!

00:03:44.010 --> 00:03:46.050
I caught you, Mepple popo.

00:03:46.050 --> 00:03:47.870
I cant take this anymore mepo.

00:03:48.900 --> 00:03:52.030
Mepple! Play with me some more popo.

00:03:52.030 --> 00:03:57.090
Popo! Popo! Popo!

00:03:52.940 --> 00:03:55.870
You've been playing all this time.

00:03:55.870 --> 00:03:57.550
Can't you be quiet for a little while?

00:03:57.550 --> 00:03:59.550
Let's play some more popo.

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:02.280
But Mepple was exhausted.

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:06.670
Let's play hide-and-seek 
popo. Hide-and-seek popo!

00:04:06.670 --> 00:04:08.040
That's enough!

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:09.960
Lunch is ready, Sis!

00:04:09.960 --> 00:04:11.530
I'll be right there!

00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:14.000
Behave yourself now!

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:21.070
Let's play some more popo!

00:04:24.710 --> 00:04:29.280
"DID HE REALLY RUN AWAY? 
WHERE IN THE WORLD IS POLLUN?!"

00:04:32.850 --> 00:04:34.410
It's delicious!

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:36.720
Today's curry is real curry, isn't it?

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:39.430
Isn't it? I watched a 
cooking show, and made it.

00:04:39.430 --> 00:04:41.910
This is what you call "karei 
naru karei" (gorgeous curry)...

00:04:41.910 --> 00:04:42.620
Just kidding!

00:04:44.170 --> 00:04:45.600
This is the pits.

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:47.230
Really?

00:04:47.230 --> 00:04:49.230
You're so funny, Dad.

00:04:54.110 --> 00:04:57.370
What are you doing, Ryota? That's my slipper.

00:04:58.070 --> 00:05:00.360
What did I do anyway?

00:05:01.190 --> 00:05:02.850
What's wrong with that girl?

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:05.930
I told you not to come out, didn't I?

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:07.080
Why not popo?

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:09.550
Because no one is supposed 
to know about you, Pollun.

00:05:09.550 --> 00:05:10.520
Why popo?

00:05:10.520 --> 00:05:11.950
Because...

00:05:11.950 --> 00:05:13.960
What are you going, Nagisa?

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:14.990
I'm coming!

00:05:16.140 --> 00:05:18.170
Just don't come outside!

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:23.240
What happened?

00:05:23.240 --> 00:05:24.700
Nothing.

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:41.220
I miss everybody popo.

00:05:43.460 --> 00:05:45.510
There's something definitely wrong mepo.

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:50.950
There's something wrong with Pollun?

00:05:51.190 --> 00:05:53.850
It's strange for him to 
be able to stay in that

00:05:53.850 --> 00:05:55.670
form for so long here on 
the Field of Rainbows.

00:05:56.010 --> 00:05:58.130
It's unthinkable mepo.

00:05:58.130 --> 00:06:00.810
He's right... He was running 
around all morning long.

00:06:00.810 --> 00:06:03.640
Do you mean that something's 
happened to Pollun?

00:06:03.870 --> 00:06:06.600
The fastest way is to ask Pollun mipo.

00:06:06.780 --> 00:06:11.400
Popo... popo... popo...

00:06:11.400 --> 00:06:12.550
Popo!

00:06:13.050 --> 00:06:13.980
Pollun...?

00:06:13.980 --> 00:06:14.770
Popo...

00:06:14.770 --> 00:06:18.100
Did something strange happen 
to you recently mipo?

00:06:18.820 --> 00:06:20.660
Something strange popo?

00:06:20.660 --> 00:06:21.720
That's right.

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:23.320
Stone Keeper popo.

00:06:23.550 --> 00:06:25.050
Stone Keeper?

00:06:25.590 --> 00:06:27.630
What about Stone Keeper mipo?

00:06:27.630 --> 00:06:29.510
Stone Keeper...

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:32.640
I forgot popo.

00:06:33.970 --> 00:06:35.050
Good grief!

00:06:35.050 --> 00:06:37.750
Let's play popo! Let's play popo!

00:06:39.490 --> 00:06:40.390
Popo...

00:06:40.770 --> 00:06:42.320
What's wrong mipo?

00:06:44.310 --> 00:06:49.020
Pollun! Hey, Pollun! Can you hear me?

00:06:49.020 --> 00:06:50.720
It's Senior popo!

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:51.680
Senior?

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:55.010
It's Senior popo! Senior popo!

00:06:55.010 --> 00:07:01.130
Pollun... I suddenly felt your 
presence so I thought just maybe...

00:07:01.130 --> 00:07:03.560
It seems you can hear my voice, can't you?

00:07:03.830 --> 00:07:06.150
Being able to talk to you 
from the Field of Light...

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:07.420
This is awesome mepo.

00:07:07.420 --> 00:07:09.160
That voice... It's...

00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:11.030
Who was it now?

00:07:11.970 --> 00:07:13.610
It's Mepple mepo!

00:07:13.610 --> 00:07:15.550
Don't forget me mepo.

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:17.620
I'm sorry.

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:19.050
It's Mipple mipo.

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:22.370
I can't believe we can hear 
your voice, too, Senior.

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:24.020
You're awesome, Pollun.

00:07:24.020 --> 00:07:27.470
I can hear all of you over 
there loud and clear...

00:07:27.470 --> 00:07:29.290
That's some power...

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:31.070
How is everybody popo?

00:07:31.070 --> 00:07:32.880
We're all fine!

00:07:32.880 --> 00:07:34.500
What about you?

00:07:37.050 --> 00:07:38.440
It's...

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:41.200
Don't tell me something 
happened to Stone Keeper?

00:07:41.410 --> 00:07:42.890
Just what we'd expect from you, Senior...

00:07:42.890 --> 00:07:44.600
You hit it on the head mepo.

00:07:44.600 --> 00:07:47.900
The truth is, Stone Keeper 
and the seven Prism Stones

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:51.180
were taken by those people 
from Dotsuku Zone mepo.

00:07:52.800 --> 00:07:54.750
So it's just as I thought.

00:07:54.750 --> 00:07:58.500
I couldn't feel the presence of 
Stone Keeper, so I was worried.

00:07:58.640 --> 00:07:59.670
Wait a minute.

00:08:00.170 --> 00:08:01.450
What's wrong mepo?

00:08:02.110 --> 00:08:04.790
In exchange for losing the 
power of the seven stones,

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:07.060
Pollun's power got stronger...

00:08:07.060 --> 00:08:08.370
Which means...

00:08:08.370 --> 00:08:09.910
Which means?

00:08:21.410 --> 00:08:25.820
The power of the seven stones 
reside inside of Pollun now.

00:08:26.050 --> 00:08:27.820
The power of the seven stones...

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:29.570
...is inside Pollun mipo?

00:08:30.790 --> 00:08:32.910
Knowing Stone Keeper...

00:08:32.910 --> 00:08:36.600
He may have entrusted the power 
of the seven stones to Pollun

00:08:36.600 --> 00:08:38.770
just before he was captured.

00:08:38.770 --> 00:08:42.890
Do you mean that Pollun now has 
the power of the seven stones?

00:08:42.890 --> 00:08:46.280
Something that powerful 
is inside his little body?

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:51.880
Of course the power itself is 
sealed up inside and sleeping,

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:55.860
otherwise, it's not something that 
Pollun can hold inside himself.

00:08:55.860 --> 00:08:59.770
Maybe the power of the stones residing inside

00:08:59.770 --> 00:09:04.830
is waking the power that's 
asleep inside of Pollun.

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:09.020
Pollun must be feeling 
some new power inside him.

00:09:09.020 --> 00:09:10.560
Mepo...?

00:09:10.560 --> 00:09:12.630
Then what happened that time must be...

00:09:27.410 --> 00:09:30.020
Pollun's new power?

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:37.000
Senior! Tell me more about everybody popo.

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:40.120
Everyone misses you, too.

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:44.300
They're all worried about how you're 
doing there on the Field of Rainbows.

00:09:44.300 --> 00:09:46.600
Also...

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:51.450
Senior! Senior!

00:09:51.450 --> 00:09:53.730
Tell me more about everybody popo!

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:56.730
But it doesn't look like we can 
talk to him for that long, does it?

00:09:57.620 --> 00:10:00.540
So the power of the seven 
stones is inside Pollun...

00:10:00.540 --> 00:10:04.340
If they find out that Pollun holds 
the power of the seven stones,

00:10:04.630 --> 00:10:07.180
they're sure to come after Pollun mepo!

00:10:07.360 --> 00:10:08.560
That's true...

00:10:11.050 --> 00:10:13.460
I'm worried about Stone Keeper, too mipo.

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:17.470
You're right. We have to hurry, and 
find out where he is, and get him back.

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:18.340
Pollun!

00:10:18.560 --> 00:10:19.550
Where are you going?

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:21.030
I'm going back to see everyone popo.

00:10:21.030 --> 00:10:22.820
Wait a minute!

00:10:27.260 --> 00:10:28.300
Over there!

00:10:28.300 --> 00:10:29.770
That Pollun...!

00:10:29.770 --> 00:10:32.610
What is he going to do 
if those guys find him?

00:10:32.610 --> 00:10:34.420
Popo! Popo! Popo!

00:10:34.420 --> 00:10:36.570
Come back here!

00:11:10.850 --> 00:11:13.720
Popo! Popo! Popo!

00:11:13.720 --> 00:11:15.620
Come back here, Pollun!

00:11:16.470 --> 00:11:17.130
Pollun!

00:11:21.620 --> 00:11:23.290
It's dangerous, Pollun!

00:11:23.290 --> 00:11:24.910
Come back here!

00:11:27.970 --> 00:11:28.830
Pollun!

00:11:33.520 --> 00:11:34.260
Pollun...?

00:11:36.530 --> 00:11:37.820
Watch out...!

00:11:37.820 --> 00:11:39.370
Oh, Nagisa... Honoka...?

00:11:39.370 --> 00:11:40.450
Akane-san!

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:43.370
I'm sorry, but please follow 
that truck in front.

00:11:43.370 --> 00:11:44.400
Please!

00:11:46.090 --> 00:11:48.140
What's wrong anyway?

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:49.820
It's...

00:11:49.820 --> 00:11:53.100
This isn't your usual car, is it, Akane-san?

00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:56.820
There's something wrong with the 
engine, so I'm having it repaired.

00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:58.060
I'm using this in its place.

00:11:59.790 --> 00:12:01.490
Is that the truck?

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:02.680
That's right.

00:12:02.680 --> 00:12:04.060
Just leave it to me.

00:12:07.930 --> 00:12:11.130
Something's stuck on top. 
Is it a stuffed animal?

00:12:11.130 --> 00:12:12.050
Pollun...

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:15.180
I'm scared popo!

00:12:15.180 --> 00:12:16.010
Pollun!

00:12:16.010 --> 00:12:16.600
Pollun...?

00:12:16.600 --> 00:12:19.040
Popo... popo... popo...

00:12:20.190 --> 00:12:20.970
Pollun!

00:12:23.170 --> 00:12:23.960
I got him!

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:25.670
Thank goodness.

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:28.520
That stuffed animal must 
be really precious to you.

00:12:28.710 --> 00:12:30.910
I didn't know what was going 
to happen there for a moment,

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:31.990
but I'm so relieved mepo.

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:33.630
Popo.

00:12:33.970 --> 00:12:35.920
Did that stuffed animal just say something?

00:12:36.630 --> 00:12:38.750
You must have imagined it.

00:12:38.750 --> 00:12:41.190
Why did you do something like that?

00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:42.610
I was lonely popo...

00:12:43.910 --> 00:12:46.440
I was lonely popo...

00:12:48.020 --> 00:12:52.470
I see... after hearing Senior's 
voice after all this time...

00:12:54.680 --> 00:12:56.340
I'll take you home.

00:12:56.340 --> 00:12:57.990
Thank you.

00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:00.120
Bu... bun...

00:13:00.270 --> 00:13:02.050
Bu.. bun... Bu... bun...!

00:13:02.370 --> 00:13:05.520
We're riding on a car right now...

00:13:05.820 --> 00:13:08.310
Rain popo! Danger popo!

00:13:08.310 --> 00:13:10.460
Rain? Danger?

00:13:12.630 --> 00:13:16.690
I'm sorry... theres construction 
ahead, so can you turn left?

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:18.370
Bu... bun!

00:13:19.530 --> 00:13:21.900
Okay, thank you!

00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:35.330
We ended up in a strange place, didn't we?

00:13:48.900 --> 00:13:50.360
Akane-san!

00:13:57.020 --> 00:13:58.630
Zakenna!

00:14:03.180 --> 00:14:06.800
Zakenna!

00:14:06.800 --> 00:14:09.280
Bu.. bun! Bu... bun!

00:14:10.140 --> 00:14:11.790
Is that what he meant by bu... bun?

00:14:11.790 --> 00:14:14.760
Zakenna!

00:14:15.840 --> 00:14:18.070
I want to ask you two something.

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:20.030
Where's the power of the stones?

00:14:20.030 --> 00:14:21.860
We don't know!

00:14:22.110 --> 00:14:24.000
Even if we did, we wouldn't 
tell you, would we?

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:26.810
How long are you going to put 
on that show of strength...

00:14:26.810 --> 00:14:28.040
Go, Zakenna!

00:14:28.040 --> 00:14:29.120
Zakenna!

00:14:31.980 --> 00:14:33.780
Hurry, and transform mepo!

00:14:33.780 --> 00:14:34.410
Honoka!

00:14:39.840 --> 00:14:42.930
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:15:17.150 --> 00:15:19.560
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:15:19.820 --> 00:15:22.260
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:15:24.430 --> 00:15:26.080
Together, we're Pretty Cure!

00:15:27.390 --> 00:15:29.670
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:32.910
Go back to where you came from!

00:15:34.100 --> 00:15:35.830
You're wasting your time.

00:15:44.550 --> 00:15:46.570
Does he seem more powerful to you?

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:48.250
He stored up the energy, didn't he?

00:15:58.950 --> 00:16:00.460
What power mepo!

00:16:00.460 --> 00:16:01.900
At this rate, you're in danger mepo!

00:16:01.900 --> 00:16:04.870
That's right. There's no way you can win.

00:16:04.870 --> 00:16:06.440
Zakenna!

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:08.230
Zakenna!

00:16:32.110 --> 00:16:34.230
Welcome to the specially constructed ring!

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:38.710
Until I find out where the power of 
the stones is there's nowhere to go.

00:16:38.710 --> 00:16:40.520
Zakenna...

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:42.480
Zakenna...

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:43.960
Zakenna...

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:49.350
Black!

00:16:53.460 --> 00:16:54.580
So this is...

00:16:58.730 --> 00:17:00.710
...what he meant by rain!

00:17:15.050 --> 00:17:18.010
Hurry, and tell me where the stones 
are, and made it easy on yourself.

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:20.340
Who would tell you?

00:17:22.200 --> 00:17:22.960
Popo!

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:26.890
Popo!

00:17:27.620 --> 00:17:28.480
Pollun!

00:17:28.880 --> 00:17:31.820
No! Popo! No! Popo!

00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:34.170
You're in the way! Get out of here!

00:17:34.640 --> 00:17:35.430
Pollun!

00:17:39.460 --> 00:17:40.880
Are you okay, Pollun?

00:17:41.270 --> 00:17:43.780
What about you, Black? Are you okay popo?

00:17:46.660 --> 00:17:48.890
How dare you do this to Pollun!

00:17:48.890 --> 00:17:49.580
I won't forgive you!

00:17:50.240 --> 00:17:51.820
What do you think you're doing?

00:17:51.820 --> 00:17:53.540
Leave this little kid out of this!

00:17:53.790 --> 00:17:56.020
That's right! We won't let you do this!

00:17:56.020 --> 00:17:57.490
That's fine with me!

00:18:01.410 --> 00:18:09.620
Stop it already popo!

00:18:18.920 --> 00:18:22.350
Accept the power of light popo!

00:18:43.440 --> 00:18:46.360
Power of hope... Take the will of light...

00:18:47.220 --> 00:18:49.800
And fight your way toward the future!

00:18:50.500 --> 00:18:54.050
Pretty Cure Rainbow Storm!

00:19:25.230 --> 00:19:28.520
Gomenna! Gomenna! Gomenna!

00:19:28.520 --> 00:19:30.830
Gomenna! Gomenna!

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:36.760
It looks like we managed to chase him off.

00:19:41.520 --> 00:19:44.850
Is this Pretty Cure's new power...?

00:19:45.890 --> 00:19:49.180
It looks like Pollun brought it out.

00:19:55.400 --> 00:19:58.400
Pollun must be really tired...

00:19:58.400 --> 00:20:01.420
After the frightening experience 
he just went through...

00:20:01.420 --> 00:20:05.630
A little kid like this is living 
all alone in a different world...

00:20:05.630 --> 00:20:07.580
It's only natural that he 
feels lonely, isn't it?

00:20:08.820 --> 00:20:11.760
We all need to stick by him mipo.

00:20:11.760 --> 00:20:12.560
That's right mepo.

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:35.940
You underestimated them a 
little, didn't you, Juna?

00:20:36.300 --> 00:20:37.500
Never mind...

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:40.250
First, we have to bring 
Jyaku-King back to life.

00:21:56.260 --> 00:21:58.420
What's wrong, Queen?

00:21:59.790 --> 00:22:01.660
Jyaku-King...

00:22:02.770 --> 00:22:04.900
Don't tell me...?

00:22:05.600 --> 00:22:07.520
He's come back to life.

00:22:22.220 --> 00:22:25.260
<i>Ah- Let's go!</i>

00:22:26.090 --> 00:22:29.190
<i>Get you! L-O-V-E Love Love!</i>

00:22:29.190 --> 00:22:29.930
<i>Get you!</i>

00:22:29.490 --> 00:22:32.530
<i>I can't do this! I'd rather be a</i>

00:22:32.530 --> 00:22:35.570
<i>young lady than a fighter and</i>

00:22:35.570 --> 00:22:38.100
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:42.140
<i>And melt your body and soul into sweets</i>

00:22:44.680 --> 00:22:47.910
<i>like chocolate parfait or handsome men</i>

00:22:47.910 --> 00:22:52.250
<i>I'm at the age to seriously 
fall head over heels in love</i>

00:22:52.250 --> 00:22:55.320
<i>I wanted to confess my love again today</i>

00:22:56.450 --> 00:22:59.820
<i>For the sake of the earth 
For the sake of everyone</i>

00:22:59.820 --> 00:23:06.330
<i>That's good, too, but haven't 
you forgotten something?</i>

00:23:07.430 --> 00:23:13.940
<i>I'm a teenager with a heart 
throbbing exciting dream</i>

00:23:13.940 --> 00:23:20.450
<i>I don't want to lose that 
normal everyday routine</i>

00:23:20.450 --> 00:23:23.180
<i>I just can't do this! 
It's romance rather than</i>

00:23:23.180 --> 00:23:26.420
<i>stress, isn't it?</i>

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:28.590
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode.</i>

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:32.190
<i>Isn't that the best source of power?</i>

00:23:32.190 --> 00:23:35.390
<i>I just can't do this! I'd rather cuddle</i>

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:38.200
<i>than fight and...</i>

00:23:38.200 --> 00:23:40.430
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:23:40.430 --> 00:23:43.100
<i>That's the most peaceful way</i>

00:23:43.100 --> 00:23:49.670
<i>So why am I stuffing my face 
with chocolates like this?</i>

00:23:53.560 --> 00:23:57.510
Let's all "peel our skin." 
and cheer Pollun up.

00:23:57.510 --> 00:23:58.780
It's "all pitch in" not "peel our skin"!

00:23:58.780 --> 00:23:59.810
That's what I meant.

00:23:59.810 --> 00:24:03.280
What is this? Not you again?

00:24:03.280 --> 00:24:04.480
Watch out, Pollun!

00:24:04.480 --> 00:24:07.340
Don't worry, Pollun. We'll protect you.

00:24:07.340 --> 00:24:08.540
After all, we're friends.

00:24:10.130 --> 00:24:12.830
"CHEER POLLUN UP! SPECIAL CARNIVAL"

00:24:12.820 --> 00:24:16.400
We'll cheer Pollun up with 
green seaweed "takoyaki."

00:24:16.400 --> 00:24:17.570
Where is it?

00:24:17.570 --> 00:24:20.230
There isn't any? That can't be!
